# Request-Only Execution

- Only do what the user explicitly asks for.
- Do not add extra features, routes, wiring, or behavior unless explicitly requested.
- If a request is ambiguous, ask a clarification question before implementing.
- Prefer placeholder or disabled behavior over inferred functionality when no destination or behavior is specified.
- Do not repurpose existing pages/components as defaults unless the user explicitly asks for that mapping.
